 result←object(State Clear)arg;size;props
 result←⍬

 :Select object._class
 :Case 'Picture'
     size←(object ##.Classes.Picture.imagesize ⍬)×⊃##.Classes._supp.MyUnits State ⍝ The full size of the image, in pixels
⍝? Would setting CBits be a better way?
     props←StartObj'Rect'
     props,←DefineBrush State
     props,←('LStyle' 5)('LWidth' 0) ⍝ Hide the edge
     props,←('Points' 0 0)('Size'size)
     State GUI props
 :Case 'Printer'
     {}object ##.Classes.Printer.Eject,0 ⍝ Just page-eject a Printer ⍝? Should I be force-ejecting a clean page?
 :Else
     ##.Error'Don''t know what to do about Clearing other controls' ⍝? Not sure what to do about other classes!
 :EndSelect
